r ${tc.label}`);\\n    process.exit(1);\\n  }\\n});\\n\\nconsole.log('ALL 5 TEST CASES VERIFIED PERFECTLY!');\\n\"","Description":"\"Expand test_phase1.js to cover all test cases\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/test_phase1.js\"","toolAction":"\"Updating test script\"","toolSummary":"\"Add test cases to test_phase1.js\""}}]}
